<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>Chunking Configuration</title>
    <style>
        h3 { ${REGULAR_LARGE_FONT_STYLE} }
        body { ${REGULAR_FONT_STYLE} }
        code { ${MONOSPACE_FONT_STYLE} }
        h3 code { font-size: inherit; }
        p { margin-top:0; }

    </style>
</head>
<body style="width: 300px">
    <h3>Chunking Configuration</h3>
    <p>Chunking controls how larger text is segmented into smaller pieces before vector embedding.</p>
    <br>
    <p>Chunking parameters:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><u>Chunk by</u> – Method determining how the text will be divided into chunks</li>
        <li><u>Split by</u> – Delimiter or rule used to break the text before chunk sizing</li>
        <li><u>Max size</u> – Maximum "Chunk by" units each chunk may contain</li>
        <li><u>Overlap</u> – Amount of content shared between consecutive chunks to retain context across boundaries</li>
    </ul>
</body>
</html>

